`verilator_config
// Vendored TV80 is 2004-era Verilog and trips modern lint (implicit widths,
// incomplete sensitivity lists Verilator ignores anyway, unused macro bits).
// Waive rather than patch: the point of vendoring is a reviewable diff
// against upstream, and lint fixes would destroy that.
lint_off -file "rtl/tv80/*"
lint_off -file "*/rtl/tv80/*"
